2026-09-01T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2145) '    FDB machine leaves (Bao-issued)               ~2026-10-01     service leaf: 30d set, 90d max. Fine, keep.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-01T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-2145) '    Admin client cert (DR-time)                   2026-10-01      break-glass leaf: 30d set, 2y max. Fine (deliberately short).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2145  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-01T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-2145) '    wt-control-gate-v2 (test leaf)                2026-09-11      WebTransport: 10d set, 14d max. Fine.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2145  1 LINE
